Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.63,0:01:17.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  大白天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.63,0:01:17.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning, day
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.76,0:01:23.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,磕到脚趾了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:23.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I stubbed my toe
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.65,0:01:30.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,磕到脚趾了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.65,0:01:30.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I stubbed my toe
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.59,0:01:44.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那可是我最爱的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.59,0:01:44.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was my favorite shirt
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.71,0:01:48.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以上是鳗鱼阿丹的歌曲  艾哲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:48.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And that was Aja by Eely Dan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:48.42,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 鳗鱼阿丹：改自钢铁阿丹，Steely Dan ]
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.42,0:01:52.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来是莱昂纳尔鱼奇的金曲  悲歌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:52.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next up is Lionel fishy with his hit, sad song
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:52.82,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 莱昂纳尔·鱼奇：\N改自莱昂纳尔·里奇，Lionel Richie ]
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.87,0:02:01.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好悲伤的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.87,0:02:01.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A so sad song
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.22,0:02:04.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个海绵宝宝可真是个爱哭鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:04.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That SpongeBob is such a crybaby
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.45,0:02:06.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可真走运
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:06.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lucky me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.45,0:02:09.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天一整天都得跟他上班
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.45,0:02:09.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I get to work with him all day
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.57,0:02:15.28,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(364,452)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.05,0:02:18.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你猜怎么着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:18.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, guess what
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.45,0:02:20.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  我等会儿再来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:20.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll come back later
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.04,0:02:27.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他曾是个上好的小肉饼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:27.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He was a good little Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.17,0:02:29.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然跟他交情不深
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.17,0:02:29.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't know him well
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.77,0:02:31.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但在那短短几秒钟内
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.77,0:02:31.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but in the few short seconds
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.33,0:02:33.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他跌落烤架掉下地面那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.33,0:02:33.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,between grill and floor
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.86,0:02:35.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我便爱上了他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.86,0:02:35.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I came to love him
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.69,0:02:42.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太不公平了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.69,0:02:42.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It just isn't fair
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.19,0:02:51.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  能不能别哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.19,0:02:51.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, will you stop crying?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.32,0:02:53.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是蟹黄堡肉饼掉到了地上  然后还
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:53.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But the Krabby Patty fell on the floor and then he--
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.68,0:02:55.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别什么蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:55.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabby Patty nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.07,0:02:55.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.07,0:02:55.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But--
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.44,0:02:58.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别什么蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:58.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabby Patty nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.82,0:03:02.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:02.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.45,0:03:05.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚刚吼我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:05.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You yelled at me
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.87,0:03:07.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚刚吼我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:07.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You yelled at me
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.27,0:03:11.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  你看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.27,0:03:11.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, look
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.44,0:03:12.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天到现在为止
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:12.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So far today
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.80,0:03:14.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连两点钟都还没到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.80,0:03:14.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and it's not even 2:00 yet
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.60,0:03:17.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就已经哭了43次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:17.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you have cried 43 times
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.93,0:03:20.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后你还把那数字写到了黑板上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:20.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you wrote that number on a chalkboard?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.76,0:03:21.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:21.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.01,0:03:21.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.01,0:03:21.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.68,0:03:25.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:25.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have no idea
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.68,0:03:27.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  我不可能哭那么多次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:27.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, there's no way I cry that much
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.90,0:03:29.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我脑袋里又没那么多眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:29.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's not that many tears in my brain
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.89,0:03:31.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恰恰相反
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.89,0:03:31.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Au contraire
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.82,0:03:32.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.82,0:03:32.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.46,0:03:35.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我特地剪辑的闪回蒙太奇短片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:35.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a quick montage of flashbacks I've edited together
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.85,0:03:39.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放的是你这些年来掉的几百滴眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.85,0:03:37.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that shows the hundreds of tears
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.69,0:03:39.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you have cried over the years
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:47.33,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(386,264)}水母田
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:52.08,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(344,334)}公交站
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.30,0:03:56.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:03:56.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.32,0:03:58.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好烫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.32,0:03:58.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It burns
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.00,0:04:00.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,几千滴眼泪后
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.75,0:04:04.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我确实很爱哭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.75,0:04:04.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Guess I do cry a lot
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.17,0:04:07.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我保证再也不哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.17,0:04:07.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I promise I won't cry anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.25,0:04:09.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.25,0:04:09.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nonsense
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.22,0:04:12.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我敢赌你坚持不到今天结束不哭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:12.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I bet you can't go the rest of the day without crying
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.85,0:04:14.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:14.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.32,0:04:22.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海星家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:22.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Star residence
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.47,0:04:23.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:23.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick speaking
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.97,0:04:24.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.97,0:04:24.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.85,0:04:26.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.85,0:04:26.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.05,0:04:27.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,已经七点半了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.05,0:04:27.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is it 7:30 already?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.86,0:04:29.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  我还在上班
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:29.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I'm still at work
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.10,0:04:30.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要我帮你什么忙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:30.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How can I help you?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.45,0:04:34.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你觉得我能一整天忍住不哭吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:31.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you think that I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:34.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,could go the rest of the day without crying?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.47,0:04:36.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然不会哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.47,0:04:36.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, of course you can
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.17,0:04:36.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:36.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, great
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.86,0:04:37.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:37.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.57,0:04:39.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.57,0:04:39.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.82,0:04:42.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还记不记得把那包裹放到外面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:42.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you remember to put that package outside
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.52,0:04:43.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我叫你放的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:43.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where I told you?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.64,0:04:45.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,记得  不过我把它放到别处了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:45.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I left it in a different spot
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.42,0:04:46.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,问小蜗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.42,0:04:46.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just ask Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.09,0:04:47.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗知道放哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:47.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He knows where it is
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.60,0:04:52.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真好笑  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.60,0:04:52.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good one, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.60,0:04:55.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,差点就被你给骗了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:55.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You almost had me there
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.23,0:04:56.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这倒是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.23,0:04:56.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.34,0:04:58.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以后再聊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.34,0:04:58.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, talk to you later
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.14,0:04:59.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  再见
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.14,0:04:59.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, see you
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.50,0:05:01.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赌就赌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:01.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's a bet
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.92,0:05:02.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.92,0:05:02.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.58,0:05:05.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要是半夜以前哭出一滴眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.58,0:05:05.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you cry one tear before midnight
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.27,0:05:07.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就必须洗我的自行车
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.27,0:05:07.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you have to wash my bike
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.70,0:05:08.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,清理我的雨水槽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:08.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,clean out my rain gutters
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.95,0:05:11.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我打理一整年的庭院
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:11.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and do all my yard work for a year
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.37,0:05:12.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得合情合理
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:12.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sounds fair to me
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.45,0:05:14.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要是半夜之前没哭出一滴眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.45,0:05:14.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And if I make it to midnight without crying
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.95,0:05:17.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就来我家开睡衣派对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:17.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you'll come to a slumber party at my place
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.30,0:05:19.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就你跟我一起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.30,0:05:19.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just you and me
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.66,0:05:21.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:21.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's a matter?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.24,0:05:22.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:22.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.75,0:05:24.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我刚刚干呕了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:24.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just threw up a little in my mouth
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.55,0:05:26.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用担心  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.55,0:05:26.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No need to worry, squiddy
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.80,0:05:28.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你简直是超常发挥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:28.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've outdone yourself
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.32,0:05:31.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他十分钟就会哭的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:31.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He'll be crying in ten minutes
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.86,0:05:42.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再次谢谢你陪我走回家  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:42.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks again for walking home with me, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.69,0:05:45.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凡事都有个第一次嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:45.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a first time for everything
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.12,0:05:48.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且我还想尽快赌赢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:48.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Also I'd like to win this bet as soon as possible
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.27,0:05:51.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不会哭的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.27,0:05:51.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna cry
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.49,0:05:52.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不会哭的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.49,0:05:52.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna cry
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.72,0:05:54.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我能行的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:54.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can do this
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.99,0:05:55.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.99,0:05:55.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do what?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.90,0:05:58.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:58.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.77,0:06:00.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,夕阳真美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.77,0:06:00.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a lovely sunset
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.55,0:06:02.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看看  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.55,0:06:02.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take a look, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.24,0:06:06.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是不是很美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.24,0:06:06.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't that beautiful?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.17,0:06:09.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从来没在水下看过这么美的夕阳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:09.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a beautiful underwater sunset
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.05,0:06:11.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是不是很扣人心弦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.05,0:06:11.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really tugs at the heartstrings, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.01,0:06:13.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.01,0:06:13.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.52,0:06:16.81,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(758,818)}裤头村合唱团
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.95,0:06:23.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是眼泪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.95,0:06:23.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that a tear I see?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.57,0:06:28.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行了  夕阳下山了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.57,0:06:28.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, sunset's over
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.25,0:06:34.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你能顺道来看我可真好  邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.25,0:06:34.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice of you to drop in, neighbor
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.10,0:06:35.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很高兴你能请我来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.10,0:06:35.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice of you to have me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.54,0:06:35.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:35.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.70,0:06:38.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:38.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.11,0:06:39.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.11,0:06:39.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary's sleeping
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.75,0:06:46.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,样子好像个天使
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.75,0:06:46.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He looks like an angel
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.10,0:06:48.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.10,0:06:48.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That is just so adorable
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.90,0:06:50.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,简直可爱到让人想哭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:50.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Almost makes you want to cry
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.53,0:06:53.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.53,0:06:53.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.65,0:06:54.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.65,0:06:54.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.55,0:06:56.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今晚家里不能哭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.55,0:06:56.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There shall be no tears in this house tonight
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.42,0:07:01.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:01.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.15,0:07:01.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:01.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.71,0:07:02.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你信送到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:02.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your mail's here
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.81,0:07:04.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:04.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.36,0:07:09.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是你远在天边的亲爸妈送的明信片
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:05.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a postcard
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:09.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from your dear mother and father so far away
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.44,0:07:10.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,妈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:10.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mother?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.02,0:07:10.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.02,0:07:10.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.72,0:07:13.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,亲爱的海绵宝宝  我们两个现在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:13.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Dear SpongeBob, we are having a wonderful time
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.89,0:07:15.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在南海玩得可开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:15.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"in the south seas
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且我们非常非常想你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and we miss you very, very much"
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.47,0:07:21.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我捉水母月刊订阅到期了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.47,0:07:21.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My subscription to jelly fishing monthly's expired
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.42,0:07:22.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能提醒我续费  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:22.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Remind me to renew that, will you, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.28,0:07:24.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:24.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No problem
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.76,0:07:29.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎继续收看裤头村新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:29.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome back to Bikini Bottom news
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.22,0:07:30.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今晚要闻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:30.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Our top story tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:32.80,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1098,644)}裤头村新闻
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.87,0:07:32.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是一连串悲情故事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.87,0:07:32.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a series of sad tales
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.19,0:07:33.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放大声点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.19,0:07:33.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's turn it up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:40.27,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(726,838)}要闻
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.16,0:07:35.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,公园发生了一场悲剧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:35.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tragedy in the park
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.47,0:07:37.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一只小蜗牛困在了树上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.47,0:07:37.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when a young snail caught in a tree
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.55,0:07:39.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,差点下不来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.55,0:07:39.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,almost didn't get down
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.86,0:07:42.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然而
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.86,0:07:42.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,However
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.80,0:07:43.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它最后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:43.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,he did
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.19,0:07:44.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:44.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get down
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.32,0:07:46.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:46.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hooray
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.44,0:07:47.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.44,0:07:47.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Coming up
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.50,0:07:49.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们专访了一只海牛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:49.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,an interview with a manatee
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.09,0:07:51.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他没要到自己日思夜想的生日礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:51.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,who didn't get what he wanted for his birthday
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.79,0:07:52.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.79,0:07:52.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.36,0:07:54.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最后是坏消息
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.36,0:07:54.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And finally, sad news
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.64,0:07:57.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩粉听了会难过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:57.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for mermaid man and barnacle boy fans
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.20,0:07:58.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:07:58.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.17,0:07:59.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,电视台每天播出
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:07:59.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They will only be showing
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.29,0:08:01.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩秀的次数
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:01.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the mermaid man and barnacle boy show
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.06,0:08:03.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从八次降到了七次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:03.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,seven times a day instead of eight
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.03,0:08:06.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是看点别的好了  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:06.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's watch something else, Squidward, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.67,0:08:07.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.67,0:08:07.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.04,0:08:10.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:10.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, dad
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.92,0:08:11.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能玩接球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:11.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about a game of catch?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.50,0:08:14.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:14.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, son
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.32,0:08:15.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我上班要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:15.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm late for work
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.97,0:08:16.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.97,0:08:16.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, dad
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.60,0:08:21.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我应该可以留下来投个几球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:21.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess I can stay for a few throws
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.98,0:08:23.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爱你  老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:23.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love you, dad
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.52,0:08:25.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爱你  儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.52,0:08:25.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love you, son
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.12,0:08:34.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,反正大伙儿都说电视会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:34.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know what they say about that television--
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.92,0:08:36.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,损害大脑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:36.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,rots the brain
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.25,0:08:37.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你送电视  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:37.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the TV, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.14,0:08:39.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要通宵看个够
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:39.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna watch it all night
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.38,0:08:47.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,越来越晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:47.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's getting late
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.82,0:08:49.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得使出杀手锏了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:49.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd better bring out the big guns
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.66,0:08:51.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:51.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.63,0:08:52.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.63,0:08:52.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.45,0:08:53.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要不要来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.45,0:08:53.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What would you say to
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.93,0:08:55.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听点音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.93,0:08:55.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a little music?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.00,0:08:57.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:57.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd say
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.32,0:08:59.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就去拿点心过来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:59.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll go and get some refreshments
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.05,0:08:59.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可别拖太久了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.05,0:08:59.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't be long
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.99,0:09:01.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我秘密武器正等着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:01.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My secret weapon is waiting
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.89,0:09:03.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚说啥  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.89,0:09:03.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You said something, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.30,0:09:07.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说的是  好好放松听歌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.30,0:09:07.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just said, "relax, and enjoy the song"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.39,0:09:07.90,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(340,334)}多愁善感\N或者类似的悲歌
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.45,0:09:23.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那首歌真的好悲伤  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:23.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a really sad song, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.52,0:09:24.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不会哭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.52,0:09:24.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna cry though, are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.97,0:09:25.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.97,0:09:25.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.79,0:09:30.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢乐的时光总是飞逝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:30.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time really does fly when you're having fun
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.87,0:09:32.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我该准备上床睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.87,0:09:32.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I better start getting ready for bed
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.18,0:09:34.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  别别别
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.18,0:09:34.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, no, no, no
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.63,0:09:35.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.63,0:09:35.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.02,0:09:35.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.02,0:09:35.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.80,0:09:37.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要不要来听睡前故事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.80,0:09:37.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about a bedtime story?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.63,0:09:39.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这才对嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.63,0:09:39.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now you're talking
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.15,0:09:41.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要念什么故事  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.15,0:09:41.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whatcha gonna read me, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.64,0:09:46.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就听听  迷路的小鮟鱇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.64,0:09:46.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about the little angler who got lost?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.79,0:09:48.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那故事感觉很悲伤啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.79,0:09:48.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a very sad story
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.56,0:09:50.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可悲伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.56,0:09:50.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Very sad
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.46,0:09:53.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从前有只小鮟鱇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:53.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There once was a little angler
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.11,0:09:53.86,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(804,206)}童谣  杰克和吉尔
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.42,0:09:56.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又小又悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:56.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,who was little and sad
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.20,0:10:00.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一天  这只悲伤的小鮟鱇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:10:00.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One day the little sad angler
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.27,0:10:02.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正在走过公园
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.27,0:10:02.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,was walking through the park
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.91,0:10:03.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:03.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Walking
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.66,0:10:05.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但他突然悲伤了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:05.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But he was sad
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.58,0:10:06.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:06.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.37,0:10:07.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.37,0:10:07.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.28,0:10:08.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他迷路了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:08.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He was lost
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.83,0:10:11.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他迷了路  可悲伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:11.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He was lost and very sad
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.34,0:10:12.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:12.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And then he--
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他就哭起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,he started to cry
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.00,0:10:17.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他哭啊哭  哭啊哭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:17.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He cried and he cried
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.55,0:10:18.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,越哭越厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:18.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and he cried even more
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.35,0:10:21.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一直哭啊哭  哭啊哭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.35,0:10:21.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And he kept crying and crying
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.80,0:10:24.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哭啊哭  哭啊哭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:24.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and crying and crying and
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.72,0:10:25.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:25.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.57,0:10:26.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你能行的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.57,0:10:26.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can do it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.28,0:10:29.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道老憋着眼泪不掉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.28,0:10:29.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering if it might not be so healthy
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.67,0:10:31.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会不会不太健康  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.67,0:10:31.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to hold in all my tears, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.70,0:10:33.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完全没错  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.70,0:10:33.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're exactly right, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.15,0:10:34.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全发泄出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:34.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let it all out
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.23,0:10:35.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别憋在心里了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:35.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't fight the feel--
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.80,0:10:38.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,十  九
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:38.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ten, nine
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.31,0:10:39.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.31,0:10:39.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.62,0:10:39.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.62,0:10:39.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.90,0:10:40.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:40.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cry
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.47,0:10:41.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,八  七
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.47,0:10:41.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eight, seven
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.86,0:10:42.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,六
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.86,0:10:42.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,six
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.49,0:10:43.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,五
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.49,0:10:43.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,five
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.50,0:10:44.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:44.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.68,0:10:45.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,四  三
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.68,0:10:45.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Four, three
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.69,0:10:46.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,二  一
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.69,0:10:46.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,two, one
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.42,0:10:51.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,半夜了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:51.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Midnight
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.47,0:10:54.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.47,0:10:54.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.55,0:10:57.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来你赌赢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.55,0:10:57.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it looks like you won the--
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.02,0:11:09.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这节目可真好看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:09.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a great show
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:10.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(362,412)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.34,0:11:14.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,起码我们还在一起  小不点们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.34,0:11:14.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, at least we're still together, little ones
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.94,0:11:16.86,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(728,958)}裤头村合唱团
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.50,0:11:26.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还要爆米花吗  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:26.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,More popcorn, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.25,0:11:26.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.25,0:11:26.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.29,0:11:28.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用  拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:28.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, please
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.85,0:11:29.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别害羞嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.85,0:11:29.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy now
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.89,0:11:30.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我多做了点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.89,0:11:30.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I made extra
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.33,0:11:35.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:35.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's all right
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.20,0:11:36.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全发泄出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:36.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let it out
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.05,0:11:38.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想怎么哭就怎么哭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:38.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can cry all you want
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.02,0:11:39.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咱都是朋友嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.02,0:11:39.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're among friends here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.73,0:11:54.23,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,暑假打工记
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:56.73,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(237.33,454)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:56.73,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:59.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:11:59.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(397.575,446)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:11:59.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(517.742,700)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:01.70,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:01.70,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:10.50,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1222,850)}泡芙老师
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.41,0:12:08.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝同学们暑假快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:08.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have a good summer vacation, class
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.98,0:12:10.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秋季开学再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.98,0:12:10.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll see you all next fall
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.83,0:12:14.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,希望别再见到某几位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:14.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, hopefully not all of you
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.38,0:12:17.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该开溜了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:17.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time to vamoose
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.02,0:12:19.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:19.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.05,0:12:22.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我钥匙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:22.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are my keys?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.00,0:12:23.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:23.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.40,0:12:24.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:24.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.10,0:12:26.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有东西要给你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:26.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got something for you
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.00,0:12:29.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:29.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.64,0:12:30.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,离我远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.64,0:12:30.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get away from me
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.10,0:12:38.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.10,0:12:38.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:40.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(312,232)}滑浪学校
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.65,0:12:41.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定得快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.65,0:12:41.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I gotta get out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.27,0:12:54.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,甩掉他了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:54.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I lost him
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.26,0:12:54.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:12:54.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.87,0:12:57.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在能把字条给你了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.87,0:12:57.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I give you my note now?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.40,0:13:00.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么就是看不懂暗示
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:13:00.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why can't you take a hint?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.14,0:13:03.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.14,0:13:03.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.13,0:13:05.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.13,0:13:05.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.45,0:13:07.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我当然会救你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:07.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course I'll help
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.09,0:13:20.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师  别忘了看字条
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.09,0:13:20.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff, don't forget to read the note
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.57,0:13:22.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他怎么就是不离
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.57,0:13:22.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why won't he just le--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.20,0:13:34.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:34.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.40,0:13:35.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.40,0:13:35.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not again
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.45,0:13:38.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万一被我的假释官发现  就没戏唱了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.45,0:13:38.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If my parole officer finds out, I don't stand a chance
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.92,0:13:41.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这回肯定会被判无期徒刑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:41.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be sentenced for life this time
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.42,0:13:44.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来你碰上了不小的难题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.42,0:13:44.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quite a conundrum you have here
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.07,0:13:47.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对某些人来说可真是不幸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.07,0:13:47.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It would be a crying shame to a certain someone
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.58,0:13:50.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被有关当局发现  肯定吃不了兜着走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:48.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if this information
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:50.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,were to leak out to the authorities
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.25,0:13:53.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你别报警
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.25,0:13:53.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, don't tell the police
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.04,0:13:55.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要是被逮就死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.04,0:13:55.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be a dead man if I get caught
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.55,0:13:56.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我什么都愿意做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.55,0:13:56.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.73,0:13:58.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得花上个不少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:13:58.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's gonna cost a fortune
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.53,0:13:59.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才能修得好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.53,0:13:59.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to get this fixed
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.20,0:14:01.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全都要怪你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.20,0:14:01.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gracious me
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.22,0:14:05.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没有那么多钱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.22,0:14:05.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't have that kind of cash
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.44,0:14:06.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:06.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.55,0:14:08.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定会有解决办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:08.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think we can work something out
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.47,0:14:12.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是说我们应该去约会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:12.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean we should go out on a date?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.25,0:14:14.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有点意思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:14.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Interesting
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.32,0:14:16.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  我有别的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:16.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I had something else in mind
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.40,0:14:17.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,惊喜  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:17.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Surprise, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.71,0:14:19.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有位新同事来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.71,0:14:19.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You have a new coworker
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.29,0:14:20.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.29,0:14:20.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.97,0:14:23.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她来负责顶替章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:23.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She'll be filling in for Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.61,0:14:24.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.61,0:14:24.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,while he's
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.52,0:14:26.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,度假去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.52,0:14:26.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,On vacation
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.76,0:14:28.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说对吧  泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:28.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Mrs. Puff?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.07,0:14:29.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.07,0:14:29.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.90,0:14:32.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她得一直免费上班
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.90,0:14:32.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And she'll be working unpaid
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.62,0:14:35.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上到章鱼哥回来  对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:35.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,until he returns, won't she?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.97,0:14:36.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.97,0:14:36.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.90,0:14:38.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.90,0:14:38.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.23,0:14:40.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,忘告诉你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:40.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I forgot to tell you
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.20,0:14:41.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要放暑假了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:41.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're taking the summer off
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.31,0:14:42.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你开心玩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.31,0:14:42.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have a good time
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.02,0:14:42.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:42.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See ya
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.40,0:14:44.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是好险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.40,0:14:44.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was close
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.32,0:14:48.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉有点神神叨叨的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:48.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It all sounds a bit mysterious to me
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.85,0:14:50.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.85,0:14:50.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But why should I care?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.07,0:14:52.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,反正我跟泡芙老师是同事了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.07,0:14:52.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm working with good old Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.65,0:14:54.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,话说你收到我字条没
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.65,0:14:54.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say, did you get my note?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.33,0:14:56.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我确实收到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.33,0:14:56.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got your note all right
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.20,0:14:58.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以你觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:14:58.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So what do you think?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.80,0:14:59.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:14:59.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What did I think?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.92,0:15:01.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都是它害得我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:01.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think it caused me to
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.90,0:15:06.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这么说吧  改变了我的一生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:06.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's just say it changed my life
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.38,0:15:07.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:07.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It certainly has
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.02,0:15:09.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.02,0:15:09.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.12,0:15:11.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,麻烦你跟泡芙老师说明一下新职责
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:11.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,would you please show Mrs. Puff her new duties
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.41,0:15:13.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就针对她最近改变的人生说明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.41,0:15:13.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,vis-a-vis her recently changed life
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.85,0:15:16.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我可没那闲工夫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.85,0:15:16.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,because I sure as snail snot can't be bothered to do it
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.68,0:15:17.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:17.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.82,0:15:20.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要来教你诀窍了  泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:20.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I get to show you the ropes, Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.85,0:15:24.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就好像我是老师一样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.85,0:15:24.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's kinda like I'm the teacher
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.15,0:15:29.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在换我来教你了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.15,0:15:29.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be teaching you now
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.53,0:15:31.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,耐心是一种美德
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:31.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patience is a virtue
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.92,0:15:35.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要先来介绍厨房卫生的重要性呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.92,0:15:33.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shall we start
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.37,0:15:35.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with the importance of good kitchen hygiene?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.59,0:15:37.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是讲述蟹黄堡全史呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.59,0:15:37.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or the unabridged history of the patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.85,0:15:41.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然先介绍我最基本的职责好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.85,0:15:41.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just start with my basic duties?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.62,0:15:43.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这么想开船上路吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:43.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eager to get behind the wheel, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.95,0:15:45.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.95,0:15:45.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I like it
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.62,0:15:46.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟着我念
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:46.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Repeat after me
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.95,0:15:48.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是我的收银机
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.95,0:15:48.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"This is my register
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.95,0:15:50.22,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 改自《步枪兵信条》 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.15,0:15:50.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无数台与其相同  但唯独这台属于我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:50.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There are many like it, but this one is mine"
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.55,0:15:53.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无数台与其相同  但唯独这台属于我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.55,0:15:53.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There are many like it, but this one is mine
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.23,0:15:56.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个旧收银机就跟船舵一样老出故障
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.23,0:15:54.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, like a ship's rudder
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:56.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,this old register is temperamental
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.75,0:15:58.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以一旦按下了总键
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.75,0:15:58.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So when you hit the total key--
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.54,0:16:00.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:00.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.12,0:16:00.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:00.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.22,0:16:03.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不记笔记吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.22,0:16:03.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not taking notes?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.20,0:16:05.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了  要得好成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.20,0:16:05.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Always remember, good grades
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.81,0:16:08.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,必须勤记笔记
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.81,0:16:08.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Only follow diligent notes
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.44,0:16:09.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.44,0:16:09.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.69,0:16:11.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那话还是我教你的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.69,0:16:11.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I taught you that phrase
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.45,0:16:12.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:12.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.55,0:16:14.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的笔记本今天可以借给你用
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:14.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You may borrow my notepad today
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.63,0:16:16.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚说到哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.63,0:16:16.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, where was I?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.04,0:16:17.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:17.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.37,0:16:19.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总键有点黏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.37,0:16:19.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The total key is a bit sticky
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.18,0:16:20.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以得用力按
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:20.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so you're going to have to be forceful
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.96,0:16:22.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过不能太用力了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.96,0:16:22.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but not too forceful
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.18,0:16:23.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,记住没
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.18,0:16:23.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you get that?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.17,0:16:25.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用力按  但不能太用力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:25.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Forceful, but not too forceful
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.97,0:16:27.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你记住了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:27.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You did
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.30,0:16:29.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这么勤奋  就该奖励一张贴纸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:29.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Diligence like this deserves a sticker
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.71,0:16:31.30,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(912,836)}你真棒
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.53,0:16:34.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,集齐十张  就能再送一张超级贴纸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.53,0:16:34.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Collect ten, and you're entitled to a "super" sticker
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:34.55,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(366,860)}超级
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.00,0:16:38.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来角色扮演  练下顾客服务好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.00,0:16:36.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't we work on our customer service
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.89,0:16:38.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with a little role playing?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.30,0:16:40.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我演客人  你向我做出你最棒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.30,0:16:40.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be the customer, and you show me your best
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.93,0:16:42.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又最友好的服务吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.93,0:16:42.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and friendliest service, hmm?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.83,0:16:43.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:43.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.95,0:16:46.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.95,0:16:46.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good day, m'lady
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.34,0:16:47.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,倍感荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.34,0:16:47.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Charmed, I'm sure
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.27,0:16:49.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你衣服好搞笑  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.27,0:16:49.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Funny costume, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.98,0:16:53.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧  我并不认识这个海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.98,0:16:53.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, but I know not of this SpongeBob fellow
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.05,0:16:55.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我叫托马斯费瑟玛芬公爵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.05,0:16:55.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My name is Duke Thomas Feathermuffin
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.20,0:16:56.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正好踏入贵店
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:56.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I entered your place of business
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.56,0:16:58.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想在这大晴天吃顿午餐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:16:58.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in hopes of procuring lunch on this fine day
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.78,0:17:01.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行  费瑟玛芬先生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.78,0:17:01.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course, Mr. Feathermuffin
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.68,0:17:03.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你今天想吃什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.68,0:17:03.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What would you like to eat today?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.35,0:17:05.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.35,0:17:05.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.15,0:17:06.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.15,0:17:06.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's me, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.08,0:17:09.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,称呼用公爵俩字就行  会顺利一点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:07.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think this will go smoother
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:09.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if you just refer to him as Duke
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.92,0:17:11.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以称呼你为公爵就行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:11.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean to refer to you as Duke
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.77,0:17:12.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.77,0:17:12.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.68,0:17:14.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然还能怎么称呼我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:14.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How else would one refer to me?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.00,0:17:15.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟我就是个公爵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:15.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am a Duke, after all
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.85,0:17:18.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,倘若你方便  我打算来用餐了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:18.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, I should fancy a meal, if it's quite all right with you
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.56,0:17:19.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好的  公爵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.56,0:17:19.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, Duke
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.92,0:17:20.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要吃些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.92,0:17:20.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What'll you have?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.68,0:17:23.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请来一点吐司面包加豆子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:23.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I shall have beans on toast, please
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.56,0:17:26.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  一份吐司面包加豆子马上来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.56,0:17:26.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, one beans on toast coming up
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.34,0:17:28.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师  我还是海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:28.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff, SpongeBob again
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.92,0:17:30.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得跟公爵说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.92,0:17:30.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You better inform the Duke
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.17,0:17:31.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王不卖吐司面包加豆子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:31.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that we don't serve beans on toast
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.80,0:17:34.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,实在太扯了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:34.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is just ridiculous
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.42,0:17:37.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就不能直接说清楚我的职责得了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:37.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you simply explain my duties, please?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.65,0:17:40.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你干什么吼我客人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.65,0:17:40.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing yelling at me customers?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.57,0:17:42.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这位公爵可是我的常客
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.57,0:17:42.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Duke here is one of me regulars
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.15,0:17:44.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我应该用不着解释
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.15,0:17:44.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I don't need to explain
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.90,0:17:49.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,失去老主顾会怎么样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:46.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what happens
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.25,0:17:49.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when you start losing your regularity, do I?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.38,0:17:51.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.38,0:17:51.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.43,0:17:53.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,收到  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.43,0:17:53.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Message received, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.34,0:17:55.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下次别再犯了  泡芙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.34,0:17:55.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just don't let it happen again, Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.16,0:17:59.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看得出来你还没有准备好出发
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:17:58.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I see you had a little trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:17:59.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,getting in gear there
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.92,0:18:02.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过你很快就可以上快船道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.92,0:18:02.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but you'll be in the fast lane before you know it
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.65,0:18:04.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又来了一位客人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.65,0:18:04.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here comes another customer
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.92,0:18:07.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看你能不能活学活用
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:07.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you can apply what you've learned
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.98,0:18:11.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临蟹堡王  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:11.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Krusty Krab, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.26,0:18:12.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要点餐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:12.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,May I take your order?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.04,0:18:13.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:13.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.00,0:18:15.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来一份蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:15.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One Krabby Patty, please
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.74,0:18:17.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总共一块钱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:17.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,$1, please
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.70,0:18:18.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:18.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.80,0:18:20.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮  泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:20.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good job, Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.17,0:18:22.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要再把单子交给厨子就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.17,0:18:22.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, all that's left is to submit the order to the cook
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.10,0:18:25.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一份蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:25.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.57,0:18:27.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.57,0:18:27.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.12,0:18:28.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:28.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.62,0:18:29.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你肯定是忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.62,0:18:29.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It must have slipped your mind
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.79,0:18:32.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还要把单子记在纸上交给我才行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.79,0:18:32.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that you need to submit the order in writing as well
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.17,0:18:34.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只有这样最清晰易懂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.17,0:18:34.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to ensure maximum clarity
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.19,0:18:35.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:35.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.77,0:18:37.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,纸质版给你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.77,0:18:37.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here's your written form
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.50,0:18:40.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一份蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.50,0:18:40.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.89,0:18:41.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.89,0:18:41.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.44,0:18:42.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.44,0:18:42.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.51,0:18:44.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,点餐铃没响  我就不能做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.51,0:18:44.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't begin cooking until the bell has rung
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.62,0:18:47.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:47.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.20,0:18:50.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过麻烦你下次稍微别那么严格了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:50.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Although a smidge less rigorous next time, please
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.65,0:18:55.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.65,0:18:55.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order up
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.05,0:18:56.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,目前表现还不错  同学
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.05,0:18:56.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've done well so far, student
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.65,0:18:59.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在来把餐点端给顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.65,0:18:59.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, we deliver the item to the customer
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.32,0:19:01.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既要小心  又要迅速
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:01.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Be cautious, but swift
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.46,0:19:03.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要是你就不会往那走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.46,0:19:03.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't go that way if I were you
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.20,0:19:05.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,往这走快一点  泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:05.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's faster if you go this way, Mrs. P
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.62,0:19:08.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心大桶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:08.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look out for the barrel
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.85,0:19:09.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我倒要给你来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:09.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a bar--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.82,0:19:13.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心行人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.82,0:19:13.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch for pedestrians
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.28,0:19:20.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坑洼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:20.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pothole
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.87,0:19:24.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心  泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.87,0:19:24.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look out, Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.00,0:19:30.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,立刻躲避
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:30.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time for evasive action
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.67,0:19:53.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡毫发无损
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.67,0:19:53.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And the patty is unscathed
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.17,0:19:55.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮  泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:55.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.00,0:19:57.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你有了第一位满意的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.00,0:19:57.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your first satisfied customer
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.02,0:19:59.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过刚刚那着陆得扣分
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:19:59.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I will have to deduct points for that landing, though
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.20,0:20:01.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:01.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.92,0:20:03.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再也不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:03.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't care anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.03,0:20:04.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根本不值得
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.03,0:20:04.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This isn't worth it
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.94,0:20:16.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我再也不能饱受屈辱了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.94,0:20:16.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I will not be humiliated any longer
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.65,0:20:23.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了看字条
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:23.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to read the note
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.36,0:20:25.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.36,0:20:25.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.85,0:20:30.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都怪你  害我陷入了这境地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.85,0:20:30.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's because of you I got stuck in this mess
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.22,0:20:35.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:35.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.96,0:20:37.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊好啊好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:37.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.85,0:20:39.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这不是泡芙老师吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.85,0:20:39.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If it ain't Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.16,0:20:42.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的所作所为我都看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.16,0:20:42.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I saw what you did
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.95,0:20:44.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.95,0:20:44.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You did?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.75,0:20:45.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.75,0:20:45.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.57,0:20:46.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.57,0:20:46.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.12,0:20:47.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不是故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:47.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to do it
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.06,0:20:47.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.06,0:20:47.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I swear
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.83,0:20:49.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在发誓已经来不及了  泡芙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.83,0:20:49.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's too late for swearing, Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.85,0:20:51.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,证据确凿  就在这
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.85,0:20:51.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The evidence is right here
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.20,0:20:53.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你乱扔垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:53.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You littered
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.73,0:20:56.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,必须去坐牢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:56.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now you're going to the stony lonesome
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.64,0:20:57.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,乱扔垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.64,0:20:57.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Littered?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.80,0:21:02.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说得可对了  警官
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:02.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right, officer
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.92,0:21:05.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还真乱扔垃圾了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:05.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, I sure did litter
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.85,0:21:07.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就那样没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.85,0:21:07.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's what I did
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.32,0:21:08.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.32,0:21:08.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.20,0:21:08.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:08.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.02,0:21:10.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你现在被逮捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.02,0:21:10.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest now
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.02,0:21:12.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题  警官
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.02,0:21:12.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No problem, officer
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.70,0:21:16.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我正好就需要坐牢独处一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:16.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time by myself in the stony lonesome is just what I need
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:21.76,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(522,612)}警察
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.77,0:21:18.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去跟法官讲吧  泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.77,0:21:18.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell it to the judge, Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:29.51,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(742,132)}裤头村监狱
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.67,0:21:32.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一天过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.67,0:21:32.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One day down
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.90,0:21:35.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还剩2528天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:35.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,2,528 to go
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.19,0:21:40.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,差不多有四年都没海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:40.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's just shy of four years without SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.34,0:21:43.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一定会爱上的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.34,0:21:43.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm going to enjoy this
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.23,0:21:44.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,起床  泡芙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.23,0:21:44.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get up, Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.12,0:21:47.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,法官说你得去上驾校
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:47.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The judge says you have to go to traffic school
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.41,0:21:54.54,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(448,252)}驾驶教育
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.41,0:21:54.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,驾驶教育课啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.41,0:21:54.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A driver's education class
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.54,0:21:58.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的老本行罢了  只不过这次没有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:58.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's just how I made a living, except without
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.87,0:22:00.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.87,0:22:00.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Him
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.70,0:22:01.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.70,0:22:01.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Delightful
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.80,0:22:03.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,同学们好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.80,0:22:03.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good day, class
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.22,0:22:09.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一定是在做噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:09.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I must be having a nightmare
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.88,0:22:11.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他来干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.88,0:22:11.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.26,0:22:14.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你没看字条吗  泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.26,0:22:14.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Didn't you read the note, Mrs. Puff?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.25,0:22:15.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给  我特地粘回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.25,0:22:15.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here, I taped it together
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.58,0:22:16.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,保存起来以防万一
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.58,0:22:16.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and saved it just in case
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.17,0:22:18.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,亲爱的泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.17,0:22:18.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Dear Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.55,0:22:20.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟随你的脚步
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.55,0:22:20.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"I'm following in your footsteps
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.65,0:22:24.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到了份暑假工  来当驾驶教育老师
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.65,0:22:24.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"and got a job as a driver's ed teacher for the summer
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.11,0:22:25.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爱你的  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.11,0:22:25.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Heart, SpongeBob"
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.36,0:22:29.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快放我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:29.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get me outta here
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.72,0:22:40.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把驾驶教育手册翻到第一章
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:40.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, let's open our driver's ed handbooks to chapter one
